/-!
# Closed, universally closed and proper morphisms of algebraic spaces

This module is a re-export of
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Spaces.UniversallyClosed`, which is where closedness,
universal closedness and properness of a morphism of algebraic spaces over a scheme `S` —
`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.IsClosedMorphism` and `AlgebraicGeometry.Space.UniversallyClosed`
of Tag 03HI and `AlgebraicGeometry.Space.IsProper` of Tag 03ZM — are defined, together with
`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.IsClosedMorphism.comp` and the four lemmas
`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.IsProper.isSeparated`,
`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.IsProper.isFiniteType`,
`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.IsProper.universallyClosed` and
`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.IsProper.mk'` relating properness to its three conjuncts.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 03HI](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/03HI)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 03ZM](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/03ZM)
-/
